    "Error is overwhelmingly near-neighbor: modular delta histogram is ~74-76% at 0, and the rest almost entirely at +1 or -1 (1023); intermediate/large offsets are essentially zero.",
    "Dominant error direction FLIPS with delay_used_ps sign: source delay -50 -> mostly +1 (23.8%); sources delay +50 -> mostly -1 (25.3%/25.4%). This is a delay/calibration signature that M2 must separate from an encoding channel.",
